  "ingredients": [
    "1 serving cooking spray",
    "1 tablespoon butter, melted",
    "1 tablespoon hot honey (such as Mike's Hot Honey®)",
    "1 teaspoon grated orange zest",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cardamom",
    "0.5 pound baby carrots",
    "1 tablespoon freshly squeezed orange juice",
    "1 pinch salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w2BJPbvRsMMlg5uVBX_wz3fB-fc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279984_AirFryerSweetandSpicyRoastedCarrots_ddmfs_Step1_3x4_3528-3a659a868fd640e4bdd8138cc6dd2e97.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279984/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Spray the basket with nonstick spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine butter, honey, orange zest, and cardamom in a bowl. Transfer 1 tablespoon of the sauce to a separate bowl and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KqB91aVi3WBFb8H8WDD1gDuYaO4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279984_AirFryerSweetandSpicyRoastedCarrots_ddmfs_Step2_3x4_3536-1719bb3a5f2341fa9f6eba45d332a013.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279984/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add carrots to remaining sauce and toss to coat. Place carrots in the air fryer basket.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3SSZVQRvo8W86YsXZzxbbKR5Gxs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279984_AirFryerSweetandSpicyRoastedCarrots_ddmfs_Step3_3x4_3540-d9f6a53e84c449e9b92ef75a46afbeba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279984/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer, tossing every 7 minutes, until carrots are roasted and fork-tender, about 15 to 22 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MOqy5efnuVEIpudJX2UhSZUpE5M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279984_AirFryerSweetandSpicyRoastedCarrots_ddmfs_Step4_3x4_3546-fe401692e1794067b83561f1d9fe5a96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279984/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix orange juice with reserved honey-butter sauce. Toss with cooked carrots until well combined. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
